{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>And in the greatness of Your majesty.</b> That is, being exalted above all that is majestic, You are able to demolish all who rise up, and You have no need for weapons of iron to demolish them — Your wrath alone You send forth and they are consumed like straw before fire, for the heat of wrath resembles fire:"], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 15, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:34:40.650225842Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}